            "notes": "[Mark of the Kitsune](item_09a53e39-25aa-4f66-ba51-bedbc543a1eb) rewards you for blinking in fights, giving you easy-to-proc burst damage on a short cooldown. I haven't tested it, but since MotK is a single hit, it should work better in a mirror matchup if they've gone for [Vital-E-Tee](item_b92e6f1d-3aac-4eec-b027-00c8e1529016) too.\n\nI like getting [Foresight](item_f4163ce1-8f80-43ca-85d4-39812084400f), as it makes it trivial to proc MotK, but feel free to adjust as you see fit. Use your insane mobility and burst damage to hunt down the enemy backline, and also to mark enemy Tracers that might be harassing your backline. Remember that with [T.Racer](item_996e13d5-9521-4312-944f-d672f528776b) you can easily chase flankers.\n\nConsider [Cushioned Padding](item_20f2f4bc-4611-4d1f-b653-20f04d56b96f) if they have an [Incendiary Blast](item_2660993e-698c-4ea0-9a65-6b1fd02f38df) [Ashe](hero_37b42a2d-a82d-4a22-9df2-4c812c873b54).",
